      "side": 1,
      "message": "The root issue appears to be that postApplyVolumeOnDevice() derives an effective index affected by the temporary internal routing mute. Please fix the volume initialization path to apply the stored stream/device index independent of mIsMutedInternally, rather than clearing the global routing mute. Otherwise this changes audible playback behavior to work around a volume bookkeeping problem.",
      "revId": "0cb44231b0916a9f39dfe9b4e1b2f6fcc8b11bb7",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
